      "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>Forgive me if I ask a very simple question. I followed instruction on how to change system language (from English to Vietnamese) but my system interface is still in English. I have searched through forum but I guess I am the only got this simple problem <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/sweat_smile.png?v=14\" title=\":sweat_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sweat_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/6/f699a07d4dc05a0d3b0d932479be5584280d7bb6.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f699a07d4dc05a0d3b0d932479be5584280d7bb6\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/6/f699a07d4dc05a0d3b0d932479be5584280d7bb6_2_690x303.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zbwBjANWIRFibLACUzbl3lRiZGS\" width=\"690\" height=\"303\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/6/f699a07d4dc05a0d3b0d932479be5584280d7bb6_2_690x303.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/6/f699a07d4dc05a0d3b0d932479be5584280d7bb6_2_1035x454.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/6/f699a07d4dc05a0d3b0d932479be5584280d7bb6_2_1380x606.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9FAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1384×609 60.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>If I need to do anything else, please tell me. Much appreciated.</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance!</p>",
